  "Name": "Vigilante 8: Arcade",
  "Overview": "Vigilante 8: Arcade is an updated re-release of Vigilante 8 to celebrate the tenth anniversary of the original game. Available only as a download through the Xbox Live Arcade service, the title has been updated with new graphics, online play over Xbox Live, and leaderboards. Also included is a new quest mode through the game to unlock hidden items.There are eight characters, and some hidden ones, and 5 levels to choose from, all taken from the original game or Vigilante 8: 2nd Offense. Up to eight players can go against each other simultaneously and there is also a splitscreen mode for two players.",
